---
description: Claude Code in this repo is routed to DeepSeek V4 Pro, not Anthropic.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Claude Code sessions in this repo run against DeepSeek's Anthropic-compatible endpoint
  (`https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic`). Model names reported as Opus/Sonnet are mapped
  server-side to `deepseek-v4-pro` / `deepseek-v4-flash`.
- Launch Claude Code with `scripts/claude-deepseek.sh` (or `.ps1`), never bare `claude`,
  or the session will fall back to Anthropic billing.
- Secrets live only in `.env.local`. Never write `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` or
  `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` into tracked files, `.claude/settings.json`, or CI YAML.
- Avoid image/multimodal tool paths in DeepSeek-routed sessions; they can break the session.
- The Claude Code plugin for Cursor is an IDE bridge only. It does not change routing.
  Cursor's own Agent still uses Cursor-hosted models.
